s."],"growth":["Revenue has compounded at 3.4% over 3 years, 8.7% over 5 years and 3.7% over 10 years, so growth is decelerating.","At current returns, reinvesting 100% of profits supports about 5.3% a year of fundamental growth, enough to sustain growth.","Forward indicators: deferred revenue up 7%.","Capex runs 2.6x depreciation (46.9% of sales), so it is building capacity for future growth.","Its Rule of 40 score is -0, below the 40 that marks a healthy growth business."],"own":["Insiders hold little stock (0.3%), and institutions hold 92%.","Insiders have only sold over the past year (10 sales, net $2.6M sold).","Shareholder yield is a modest 0.6% (2.6% in dividends, less 1.8% of net share issuance).","The share count has grown 1.4% a year over five years, diluting existing holders.","It has paid a dividend for 28 consecutive years, raising it 9.2% a year over the last five."],"people":["With about 8,913 employees, each generates about $987K of revenue, in line with the Utilities median.","Free cash flow is negative, at -$87K per employee.","CEO pay is $5.3M (5x revenue per employee).","Stock compensation averages $3K per employee."]},"profile":{"v":"AVOID","conv":27,"head":"Avoid: priced 53% above its fair value of $74.83.","pros":["Revenue grew 8.7%/yr over 5y"],"cons":["Trades 53% above fair value of $74.83","ROIC 5.3% vs WACC 6.1%","FCF margin 8.8% (burns cash)","Net debt/EBITDA 5.4x","Interest coverage only 2.6x"],"flags":["Priced 53% above its fair value of $74.83","Earns below its cost of capital and burns cash"],"need":[],"buy_below":63.6,"vc":{"base":74.83,"base_src":"blend","bear":null,"bull":null,"alt_median":74.83,"n_alt":3,"gap":null,"dispersion":0.2479,"level":"MEDIUM","why":[]},"med":{"pe":20.2834,"ev_ebitda":12.5675,"pfcf":19.9631,"pb":1.8172,"roic":0.0568,"gross_margin":0.3591,"fcf_margin":-0.0633,"div_yield":0.0325}},"ticker":"AEE","date":"2026-11-13"}